WEBVTT

01:41.770 --> 01:48.970
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.350 --> 01:51.900
[Episode 20]

02:32.320 --> 02:33.250
Why are you here?

02:38.040 --> 02:39.250
Do you think

02:39.990 --> 02:41.520
you're so great?

02:46.570 --> 02:47.430
Three million.

02:51.630 --> 02:54.630
You paid back 3 million by yourself
over these 5 years.

02:56.840 --> 02:58.500
Disappearing without a word—

02:58.740 --> 03:00.270
what did you take us for?

03:05.870 --> 03:07.200
This is my own business.

03:08.680 --> 03:09.560
I can handle it.

03:09.910 --> 03:10.870
You handle it?

03:13.080 --> 03:14.560
You just lock yourself up here every day,

03:14.560 --> 03:15.590
working day and night,

03:15.590 --> 03:16.840
gritting your teeth,

03:16.960 --> 03:18.520
and refusing help from others.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.400
Is this your way of handling it?

03:22.680 --> 03:24.840
You are so stupid, Jiang Yubai!

03:32.400 --> 03:34.150
If you hadn't disappeared,

03:34.280 --> 03:35.540
and you had trusted us,

03:36.280 --> 03:37.520
even if you had to work to make money,

03:37.520 --> 03:39.000
we could have helped you.

03:40.079 --> 03:42.030
Duan Qiyan
could have helped you find clients,

03:42.030 --> 03:43.990
Tang Tingting
could have helped you with promotion,

03:43.990 --> 03:46.720
and Jin Baihui
could have helped you with design.

03:47.430 --> 03:48.710
At least you wouldn't have to be

03:48.710 --> 03:50.710
so tired and lonely all by yourself.

03:52.400 --> 03:55.190
We wouldn't have to worry every day about

03:55.280 --> 03:56.840
where you were

03:56.840 --> 03:58.100
and how you were doing.

04:00.750 --> 04:02.680
You could have even gone to school.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.190
These 5 years

04:06.870 --> 04:08.630
wouldn't have to be like this.

04:14.310 --> 04:17.430
But you made
the most selfish and stupid choice.

04:22.360 --> 04:25.160
Do you think you protected everyone
by doing this?

04:26.680 --> 04:27.430
You didn't.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.390
Other than

04:29.390 --> 04:30.830
your own little ego,

04:30.830 --> 04:32.190
you protected nothing.

04:32.360 --> 04:34.130
You hurt all of us,

04:34.159 --> 04:35.420
especially yourself.

04:35.870 --> 04:37.159
You hurt our friendship,

04:37.159 --> 04:38.240
wasted your talent,

04:38.240 --> 04:40.750
and gave up many better possibilities
for yourself!

04:40.750 --> 04:42.480
Jiang Yubai, you big fool!

04:44.190 --> 04:45.800
You are really stupid.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.310
Lin Zhixia.

04:51.510 --> 04:52.710
It's been five years—

04:54.040 --> 04:56.100
more than a thousand days and nights.

04:57.080 --> 04:58.409
I wish I could explain it

04:59.250 --> 05:00.810
in a few words like you do.

05:01.890 --> 05:04.090
Of course I wanted to protect everyone.

05:06.080 --> 05:07.740
But this is all I'm capable of.

05:14.310 --> 05:16.110
But you shouldn't have run away.

05:16.920 --> 05:18.000
You shouldn't have buried your head

05:18.000 --> 05:19.530
in the sand like an ostrich.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.680
That was too selfish.

05:25.430 --> 05:26.160
Yeah.

05:29.120 --> 05:29.870
I'm stupid

05:32.040 --> 05:32.770
and selfish.

05:35.190 --> 05:36.360
I’m an idiot.

05:41.310 --> 05:42.480
You've seen

05:44.909 --> 05:46.159
right through me.

05:57.159 --> 05:57.950
Then what...

06:00.240 --> 06:01.750
are you going to do next?

06:11.190 --> 06:13.190
I can't just throw away

06:14.830 --> 06:16.230
my worthless ego.

06:18.630 --> 06:20.760
Otherwise, what do I have to hold on to?

06:31.510 --> 06:33.510
I will try to reply to your messages.

06:38.820 --> 06:40.090
Just give me some time.

06:59.360 --> 07:00.240
I won't repeat

07:01.120 --> 07:02.920
the importance of this project.

07:03.040 --> 07:05.360
So for the overall success of the project,

07:05.360 --> 07:06.800
and to ensure we don't waste anyone's

07:06.800 --> 07:08.260
precious time and energy,

07:08.870 --> 07:11.130
I have discussed it with the department.

07:11.240 --> 07:14.040
Now we need to make
some necessary optimizations.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.750
Please don't let it be me.

07:15.750 --> 07:18.310
I'm counting on this project
to help me find a job.

07:18.310 --> 07:19.120
A job?

07:19.500 --> 07:20.430
I'm struggling just to graduate.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.680
The list is out.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.070
Shasha.

07:26.000 --> 07:26.800
Lu Ping.

07:28.450 --> 07:29.310
That was close.

07:30.510 --> 07:31.300
That's awful.

07:31.300 --> 07:34.500
What are they going to do
about their graduation project?

07:36.040 --> 07:38.270
Actually, the department
is also in a difficult position.

07:38.270 --> 07:40.200
Forcing you to stay in this project

07:40.409 --> 07:42.570
would be torture for you

07:43.190 --> 07:45.190
and irresponsible for the project.

07:46.270 --> 07:47.070
So,

07:47.950 --> 07:49.080
I will try my best...

07:49.310 --> 07:51.120
I can only say that I'll try my best

07:51.120 --> 07:52.510
to communicate with teachers
of other projects

07:52.510 --> 07:53.120
and see

07:53.120 --> 07:55.680
if we can transfer you
to a more suitable research group

07:55.680 --> 07:57.940
that can better utilize your strengths.

07:58.890 --> 07:59.890
Did you hear that?

08:01.060 --> 08:03.840
Kicking you two out is for your own good.

08:07.390 --> 08:08.850
As for the other students,

08:09.360 --> 08:12.390
you must also be mentally prepared
for this.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.950
Don't let it all be for nothing
in the end.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.240
[Experimental Center, School of Mathematical Sciences,
Qingbei University]

08:18.950 --> 08:21.120
Keeping everyone
in their most suitable position

08:21.120 --> 08:23.550
is being the most responsible
for the project

08:23.550 --> 08:26.350
and the greatest protection
for them personally.

08:26.560 --> 08:27.240
Am I wrong?

08:30.310 --> 08:31.420
It's a deal then.

08:33.049 --> 08:33.740
Luo Ying.

08:41.500 --> 08:42.960
What did you mean just now?

08:43.220 --> 08:44.530
In front of everyone,

08:44.620 --> 08:46.620
you embarrassed and undermined me.

08:47.500 --> 08:49.900
I just couldn't stand you bullying others.

08:50.290 --> 08:51.890
Relying on your seniority and the project,

08:51.890 --> 08:53.290
you treat students as consumables

08:53.290 --> 08:55.290
and throw them away
when you're done using them.

08:55.290 --> 08:56.050
Tan Qianche,

08:56.620 --> 08:58.500
your extreme utilitarian methods

08:58.500 --> 08:59.760
are truly disgusting.

09:02.770 --> 09:05.650
Scientific research competition
is just this cruel.

09:05.650 --> 09:06.860
I only want results.

09:06.940 --> 09:07.740
Yes,

09:08.170 --> 09:10.630
you want your results
and your performance.

09:10.700 --> 09:11.890
But when we voted earlier,

09:11.890 --> 09:13.700
pulling this on Lin Zhixia

09:14.050 --> 09:15.450
was really unnecessary.

09:17.860 --> 09:20.790
Don't think everyone
can't see your little schemes.

09:21.050 --> 09:23.180
You just want to be an academic tyrant,

09:23.370 --> 09:25.830
turning the lab
into your own dictatorship,

09:26.010 --> 09:28.580
where those who submit thrive
and those who resist perish.

09:28.580 --> 09:30.370
You squeeze the value
out of the useful ones

09:30.370 --> 09:32.100
and kick away the useless ones.

09:32.940 --> 09:35.130
All resources must revolve around you,

09:35.130 --> 09:37.460
and all achievements must bear your name.

09:37.530 --> 09:38.770
Zhixia is just another person

09:38.770 --> 09:40.370
who refused to bow to you,

09:40.700 --> 09:42.930
so you targeted her like this.

09:49.230 --> 09:51.090
Where those who submit thrive...

09:51.940 --> 09:52.740
Exactly.

09:53.170 --> 09:54.890
Those who
follow the right research direction

09:54.890 --> 09:56.220
and produce efficiently

09:56.220 --> 09:58.080
should receive the most support.

09:58.820 --> 10:00.530
This isn't being an academic tyrant.

10:00.530 --> 10:03.530
This is basic efficiency
and survival of the fittest.

10:03.700 --> 10:05.960
Stop glorifying yourself, Tan Qianche.

10:06.410 --> 10:08.650
Don't think everyone is like you.

10:09.530 --> 10:11.220
At least Lin Zhixia isn't.

10:11.860 --> 10:12.620
Also,

10:13.220 --> 10:15.820
we don't need to talk
when we meet in the future.

10:15.940 --> 10:18.000
I can't keep up with your efficiency.

10:19.290 --> 10:20.290
From now on,

10:22.230 --> 10:24.430
I'm also quitting your research group.

10:51.770 --> 10:52.580
Thank you.

11:19.540 --> 11:21.910
[Photos and Videos]

11:21.940 --> 11:23.780
[Sending]

11:23.810 --> 11:24.830
[Photos and Videos]

11:24.990 --> 11:27.850
[Class Break]

11:30.740 --> 11:31.860
Being away from home for years,

11:31.860 --> 11:33.890
I don't even know
how to buy a bottle of water anymore.

11:33.890 --> 11:35.750
How on earth do you use this thing?

11:39.290 --> 11:41.580
What? You're back?

11:42.250 --> 11:43.340
Did you manage to get some water?

11:43.340 --> 11:44.500
Do you need me to transfer some money?

11:44.500 --> 11:45.970
Don't die of thirst.

11:49.130 --> 11:51.240
Dr. Shen has returned from his studies

11:51.240 --> 11:52.690
to contribute to his hometown.

11:52.690 --> 11:53.530
Welcome back!

11:58.990 --> 12:00.850
I still have some paperwork to do.

12:01.410 --> 12:03.130
Once I settle down
in the next couple of days,

12:03.130 --> 12:05.100
let's grab a bite together.

12:35.170 --> 12:37.500
What did the Academic Affairs Office say?

12:40.410 --> 12:42.130
I'm doomed.

12:42.890 --> 12:44.890
I delayed my graduation for 2 years.

12:44.890 --> 12:47.550
My credits and research results
are not enough.

12:47.620 --> 12:50.100
And there is no suitable project
this year.

12:51.980 --> 12:52.780
Basically...

12:53.100 --> 12:55.630
Basically,
I'll just leave without a degree.

12:58.770 --> 13:00.030
Are you satisfied now?

13:01.530 --> 13:03.190
It's all because of your vote.

13:04.940 --> 13:06.940
It's useless to talk about this now.

13:07.650 --> 13:09.000
For the project I'm leading,

13:09.000 --> 13:10.170
if you're willing,

13:11.130 --> 13:12.790
I hope you can come and help me.

13:13.130 --> 13:14.410
Help you, Lin Zhixia?

13:15.010 --> 13:17.070
You're trying to kill me, aren't you?

13:17.830 --> 13:20.010
Look at the workload of this project

13:20.460 --> 13:21.410
and its difficulty.

13:21.410 --> 13:22.170
With just the two of us,

13:22.170 --> 13:24.170
we won't finish it
even when I leave without a degree.

13:24.170 --> 13:25.620
What's the use of me joining?

13:25.620 --> 13:26.890
It's still a dead end.

13:27.100 --> 13:28.340
Is there a difference?

13:28.340 --> 13:30.200
Although there are only two of us,

13:30.620 --> 13:33.880
-these data modules...
-Who said there are only two of you?

13:36.050 --> 13:37.460
How can you leave us out

13:37.480 --> 13:38.940
of such an interesting project?

13:38.940 --> 13:40.650
I can take charge of data processing

13:40.650 --> 13:42.010
and visualization.

13:42.030 --> 13:43.810
I've practiced a lot recently.

13:45.460 --> 13:47.890
For algorithm optimization
and simulation tests,

13:47.890 --> 13:48.890
I can give it a try.

13:49.620 --> 13:51.700
Aren't you in Tan Qianche's group?

13:52.100 --> 13:53.300
Don't talk nonsense.

13:53.650 --> 13:55.380
We have broken ties
with that academic tyrant

13:55.380 --> 13:56.910
and come to join Lin Zhixia.

13:58.740 --> 14:01.270
Do you have some confidence now,
Yang Shuwen?

14:02.050 --> 14:04.000
It's not just the two of you now.

14:05.170 --> 14:06.620
It's a group of us.

14:08.580 --> 14:10.110
Welcome, new team members.

14:19.700 --> 14:20.340
Shen.

14:21.220 --> 14:22.170
You just arrived,

14:22.170 --> 14:24.860
so get familiar with the environment
as soon as possible.

14:24.860 --> 14:27.250
This is the post-transplant
observation area.

14:27.250 --> 14:28.890
It has strict sterile requirements.

14:28.890 --> 14:29.890
Hello, Director.

14:30.620 --> 14:33.020
These are the regular chemotherapy wards.

14:33.290 --> 14:34.740
They have a high patient turnover.

14:34.740 --> 14:37.050
Unlike other departments,

14:37.500 --> 14:40.630
the patients we admit
all have complicated conditions.

14:41.460 --> 14:42.220
I see.

14:42.370 --> 14:44.410
I'll get familiar with the patients' conditions
as soon as possible.

14:44.410 --> 14:46.340
Look, we've got everything here. Let's go.

14:46.340 --> 14:48.070
I won't do a bone marrow biopsy!

14:48.410 --> 14:49.170
Shui, don't be like this.

14:49.170 --> 14:50.170
Calm down.

14:50.410 --> 14:52.200
I won't do it! I won't do it!

14:52.650 --> 14:54.050
-Shui, don't be like this. Calm down.
-I won't do it!

14:54.050 --> 14:56.220
I won't do it. I said I won't!

14:56.370 --> 14:58.770
-I don't want to do it anymore!
-Bed 5, Shui.

14:59.480 --> 15:01.630
Acute promyelocytic leukemia.

15:03.250 --> 15:04.530
All plans have failed.

15:05.940 --> 15:07.340
Her bone marrow is a mess.

15:08.890 --> 15:09.770
Currently,

15:12.820 --> 15:14.280
there is no good solution.

15:16.630 --> 15:18.230
It's mainly palliative care

15:18.510 --> 15:20.370
with some necessary monitoring.

15:22.390 --> 15:23.200
Her family

15:24.550 --> 15:26.030
wants her to suffer less.

15:34.820 --> 15:36.820
Has she always been this resistant?

15:38.370 --> 15:39.410
Sometimes.

15:41.870 --> 15:42.650
Shui.

15:43.340 --> 15:43.980
I know

15:44.270 --> 15:46.400
the treatment is very uncomfortable.

15:46.600 --> 15:47.510
But look,

15:47.550 --> 15:49.950
your numbers are slowly improving, right?

15:50.720 --> 15:52.630
You've been in the hospital for so long.

15:52.630 --> 15:55.030
Don't you have a lot of things
you want to do?

15:55.720 --> 15:57.980
Don't you want to be discharged earlier?

16:07.360 --> 16:08.690
Then I'll only accept it

16:09.030 --> 16:10.090
if he does it for me.

16:55.680 --> 16:56.880
[Lin Zhixia]

17:05.000 --> 17:05.730
Jiang Yubai,

17:05.940 --> 17:08.369
I solved a big problem today.

17:08.900 --> 17:10.500
Want to grab a meal together?

17:10.730 --> 17:17.369
[Lin Zhixia]

17:18.619 --> 17:19.880
What do you want to eat?

17:20.980 --> 17:22.250
Come find me first.

17:22.280 --> 17:24.480
Let's decide together. How about that?

17:30.070 --> 17:30.740
Now?

17:34.180 --> 17:36.060
The machines in my lab
are processing data.

17:36.060 --> 17:37.640
I have nothing to do right now.

17:37.640 --> 17:38.640
I'll wait for you.

17:42.350 --> 17:44.750
See you downstairs at the lab in an hour.

17:46.350 --> 17:47.080
Great.

18:07.750 --> 18:09.380
This is Lab Building A.

18:11.030 --> 18:12.460
That is Lab Building B.

18:13.980 --> 18:17.220
Isn't that the beautiful genius
from the Math Department?

18:17.220 --> 18:18.220
Who is that guy?

18:18.240 --> 18:19.250
What do you want to eat?

18:19.250 --> 18:20.400
Maybe it's her brother?

18:20.400 --> 18:21.400
Anything is fine.

18:23.270 --> 18:24.350
Let me think.

18:25.510 --> 18:27.250
Good afternoon, Dr. Lin.

18:27.480 --> 18:28.530
-Good afternoon.
-Senior.

18:28.530 --> 18:29.920
I figured out the algorithm
you explained last time.

18:29.920 --> 18:31.010
You are amazing.

18:31.010 --> 18:31.810
That's great.

18:32.140 --> 18:33.880
Feel free to ask me
if you have any questions.

18:33.880 --> 18:35.080
We'll be leaving now.

18:35.160 --> 18:35.920
Bye-bye.

18:36.750 --> 18:38.310
Is that guy a school staff member?

18:38.310 --> 18:39.270
How did he get together with her?

18:39.270 --> 18:40.330
I know what to eat.

18:40.900 --> 18:42.510
-Hello, Dr. Lin.
-Hello, Dr. Lin.

18:42.510 --> 18:44.240
Stir-fried beef in Canteen 3.

18:46.480 --> 18:48.110
I can afford a meal.

18:48.260 --> 18:50.190
You don't have to save money for me.

18:50.270 --> 18:51.670
It's not about the money.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.130
You have no idea,

18:53.130 --> 18:54.440
in Canteen 3 of our school,

18:54.440 --> 18:56.100
there is a very popular stall.

18:56.110 --> 18:58.510
The stir-fried beef
is the chef's specialty,

18:58.510 --> 19:00.590
perfectly cooked and in limited supply.

19:00.590 --> 19:01.590
I've been here for 5 years,

19:01.590 --> 19:03.390
and I've never managed to get it.

19:04.240 --> 19:06.500
So, are you confident we'll get it today?

19:10.550 --> 19:11.270
Okay.

19:12.160 --> 19:13.940
It's not peak dining time
right now anyway.

19:13.940 --> 19:14.920
Let's go now.

19:15.550 --> 19:16.270
Let's go.

19:18.790 --> 19:19.590
Hurry up!

19:24.350 --> 19:25.160
Senior.

19:26.750 --> 19:28.550
Senior, finally I found you.

19:28.550 --> 19:29.250
Help me.

19:29.590 --> 19:30.390
What's wrong?

19:30.440 --> 19:31.480
We were researching

19:31.480 --> 19:33.640
an optimization problem this afternoon
and got stuck.

19:33.640 --> 19:35.550
We went to the lab just now
and they said you weren't there.

19:35.550 --> 19:36.950
Here. Please take a look.

19:38.880 --> 19:39.680
You guys talk.

19:40.090 --> 19:41.220
I'll go buy the food.

19:43.590 --> 19:44.450
It's like this.

19:44.460 --> 19:46.940
Suppose we have a non-convex,
high-dimensional energy

19:46.940 --> 19:49.590
embedding mapping of molecular
and atomic coordinates.

19:49.590 --> 19:51.240
It does not meet the requirements
of the objective function.

19:51.240 --> 19:52.830
Please help us analyze this

19:52.830 --> 19:54.630
and figure out what we should do.

19:54.680 --> 19:56.720
You can use
the accelerated gradient method.

19:56.720 --> 19:58.440
Ma'am, I want this and this.

20:00.550 --> 20:02.350
Ma'am, I want this and this.

20:06.960 --> 20:07.820
Very detailed.

20:08.000 --> 20:08.790
Thank you.

20:12.440 --> 20:15.030
Ma'am, I want
2 portions of stir-fried beef.

20:15.030 --> 20:15.750
And...

20:15.750 --> 20:16.880
Stir-fried beef?

20:17.310 --> 20:18.240
It sold out long ago.

20:18.240 --> 20:19.240
You came so late.

20:19.240 --> 20:20.240
Are you new here?

20:21.240 --> 20:22.790
Order something else, will you?

20:22.790 --> 20:23.590
Let me think.

20:28.350 --> 20:29.200
Excuse me.

20:31.000 --> 20:34.000
Ma'am, I'll have a portion of tomatoes
and this one.

20:35.790 --> 20:37.160
Hello, Jiang.

20:37.350 --> 20:38.070
I can't hear you.

20:38.070 --> 20:38.720
Hello?

20:39.400 --> 20:40.270
It's okay now.

20:40.510 --> 20:42.070
Jiang, something bad happened.

20:42.070 --> 20:43.200
The old man from last time—

20:43.200 --> 20:44.880
his speaker has a problem again.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.000
He said the bass is still not good,

20:46.000 --> 20:47.160
too boomy and muffled.

20:47.160 --> 20:48.590
He also criticized
your modification skills.

20:48.590 --> 20:49.880
I've talked my head off,

20:49.880 --> 20:51.030
but he is just not satisfied.

20:51.030 --> 20:51.790
He's very angry.

20:51.790 --> 20:55.070
Come on. I've modified it 3 times
according to his requests.

20:55.070 --> 20:56.030
Three times.

20:56.310 --> 20:58.090
The speaker is already at its limit.

20:58.090 --> 20:59.310
It's the law of physics.

20:59.310 --> 21:00.710
There's nothing I can do.

21:00.870 --> 21:01.880
Tell him this—

21:02.400 --> 21:04.030
either use it as it is,

21:04.050 --> 21:05.450
or just change the box.

21:05.640 --> 21:06.440
I can't do anything about it.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.400
My bro.

21:07.640 --> 21:08.440
Master Jiang.

21:08.540 --> 21:10.300
I don't dare to say that.

21:10.590 --> 21:12.270
This old man,
even though he's about to retire,

21:12.270 --> 21:13.670
has a lot of connections.

21:13.880 --> 21:16.140
Our little shop can't stand his nagging.

21:16.350 --> 21:18.240
He doesn't contribute much to our income,

21:18.240 --> 21:19.880
but if he spreads
negative comments about us,

21:19.880 --> 21:21.410
it could do serious damage.

21:21.880 --> 21:23.310
The machine has already been sent back.

21:23.310 --> 21:25.570
Please think of a way as soon as possible.

21:25.880 --> 21:26.410
Alright.

21:27.680 --> 21:28.720
I'll check it tomorrow morning.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.590
No, not tomorrow, bro.

21:30.790 --> 21:31.750
Where are you now?

21:31.750 --> 21:33.640
The old man is losing his temper here,

21:33.640 --> 21:34.880
saying if he doesn't hear
a satisfying sound tonight,

21:34.880 --> 21:35.750
he won't sleep.

21:36.070 --> 21:37.790
If he doesn't sleep,
I can forget about sleeping too.

21:37.790 --> 21:39.830
Jiang, I'm begging you.
Please help.

21:39.830 --> 21:40.760
Okay.

21:41.440 --> 21:42.240
I got it.

21:48.920 --> 21:49.310
Is it this one?

21:49.310 --> 21:51.880
Is the interval between 0 and 0.2?

21:51.880 --> 21:52.790
It's...

21:53.030 --> 21:54.200
0.05.

21:54.200 --> 21:55.400
-It’s all wrong.
-Yes.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.110
Right?

21:56.680 --> 21:57.880
Any other questions?

21:58.000 --> 21:58.680
No.

22:00.030 --> 22:00.790
Senior.

22:00.790 --> 22:02.110
The East China campus mixer

22:02.110 --> 22:03.480
has invited us twice.

22:03.530 --> 22:04.400
Let's go together.

22:04.400 --> 22:05.240
I think I'll pass.

22:05.240 --> 22:06.920
You are the face of our math department.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.650
You'll blow them away if you go.

22:08.880 --> 22:10.270
I'll message you later.

22:10.870 --> 22:11.880
My friend is waiting for me.

22:11.880 --> 22:12.570
I have to go.

22:13.110 --> 22:13.830
Bye.

22:13.830 --> 22:14.360
Bye-bye.

22:14.510 --> 22:15.400
Bye-bye.

22:18.200 --> 22:19.200
Smells so good.

22:20.240 --> 22:20.900
I'm sorry.

22:21.750 --> 22:23.070
I didn't get the beef.

22:24.000 --> 22:26.350
It's fine. It's hard to get anyway.

22:26.640 --> 22:28.040
These dishes are enough.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.400
Try this.

22:30.510 --> 22:31.960
It's really tender.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.640
-Senior Lin.
-Senior Lin.

22:35.640 --> 22:37.160
We rarely see you in Canteen 3.

22:37.160 --> 22:38.110
How come you have time today?

22:38.110 --> 22:38.830
Senior Lin,

22:39.480 --> 22:41.070
may I have your WeChat?

22:41.160 --> 22:43.140
I have so many questions for you.

22:50.980 --> 22:51.610
Thank you.

22:52.110 --> 22:53.110
By the way, Senior Lin,

22:53.110 --> 22:54.160
about my paper...

22:54.160 --> 22:55.890
How about I look at it on WeChat?

22:56.110 --> 22:57.270
My friend is here.

22:58.720 --> 22:59.880
Okay.

22:59.880 --> 23:01.030
Thanks, Senior. No problem.

23:01.030 --> 23:01.790
Bye, Senior.

23:01.790 --> 23:03.590
We'll keep in touch, Senior Lin.

23:08.250 --> 23:10.450
Don't worry about the beef.

23:10.590 --> 23:12.250
I just came here to try my luck.

23:13.010 --> 23:14.040
Lin Zhixia,

23:15.030 --> 23:15.960
I just...

23:17.240 --> 23:18.200
Senior Lin?

23:18.440 --> 23:19.310
I've heard so much about you.

23:19.310 --> 23:21.510
We can never register for your classes.

23:22.070 --> 23:23.310
Come earlier next time.

23:23.310 --> 23:24.510
Okay. Thanks, Senior.

23:24.510 --> 23:25.880
Bye-bye, Senior Sister.

23:25.880 --> 23:27.070
She is Lin Zhixia?

23:27.160 --> 23:27.960
Yes.

23:29.070 --> 23:30.400
I rarely come here.

23:30.400 --> 23:32.110
I usually eat near the lab.

23:32.510 --> 23:33.310
Try this.

23:39.790 --> 23:41.880
I just remembered I...

23:42.200 --> 23:44.030
have something urgent to handle.

23:44.030 --> 23:46.230
I'll spend more time with you next time.

23:46.790 --> 23:47.520
I'm leaving.

23:57.440 --> 23:58.920
Jiang Yubai, wait.

24:01.110 --> 24:03.070
I'm sorry. I ruined your meal.

24:05.880 --> 24:06.680
It's not that.

24:08.130 --> 24:09.330
It's my own business.

24:09.330 --> 24:10.260
I know.

24:10.880 --> 24:11.960
I was talking to others

24:11.960 --> 24:13.240
and left you hanging.

24:14.680 --> 24:15.810
Don't overthink it.

24:16.590 --> 24:17.690
I really have something urgent.

24:17.690 --> 24:18.750
Then I'll go with you.

24:18.750 --> 24:19.240
No need.

24:25.270 --> 24:26.800
You don't need to see me off.

24:27.240 --> 24:27.960
Go back.

24:29.030 --> 24:30.560
I'll come see you next time.

24:31.940 --> 24:32.850
Are you mad?

24:47.700 --> 24:48.700
No.

24:51.570 --> 24:52.830
You are doing well now.

24:54.290 --> 24:56.550
Your trajectory hasn't deviated at all.

24:57.070 --> 24:58.920
You are what you wanted to be.

25:00.850 --> 25:02.380
Of course I'm happy for you.

25:05.050 --> 25:05.780
It's just...

25:06.480 --> 25:07.770
It's just that I am not at all the person

25:07.770 --> 25:08.750
I wanted to be.

25:11.440 --> 25:13.900
This high-dimensional whatever,
this bullshit function stuff...

25:13.900 --> 25:15.630
I don't understand a word of it.

25:16.110 --> 25:17.460
Every day, all I think about is

25:17.460 --> 25:19.520
how to solder the next circuit board,

25:19.810 --> 25:21.420
how to deal with difficult clients,

25:21.420 --> 25:22.950
and how to save enough money

25:25.740 --> 25:26.800
to pay off my debts.

25:28.920 --> 25:30.380
Lin Zhixia, you know what?

25:32.030 --> 25:33.890
For a moment, I suddenly felt like

25:35.330 --> 25:37.000
we don't live in the same world anymore.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.320
Debts can be paid,

25:39.400 --> 25:40.700
and problems can be solved.

25:40.700 --> 25:42.560
-There will be a way.
-Lin Zhixia.

25:44.310 --> 25:46.110
Let me think about it carefully.

25:46.590 --> 25:48.250
Let's talk another day, okay?

25:49.180 --> 25:51.010
Are you going to hide again?

25:52.000 --> 25:54.530
I just want to figure this out
by myself first.

25:57.660 --> 25:58.270
Alright?

26:07.310 --> 26:08.240
I'm leaving now.

26:49.380 --> 26:50.050
Hou Wei.

26:50.290 --> 26:52.570
We must get this guy.

26:52.940 --> 26:55.600
I pulled a lot of strings
to get in touch with him.

26:55.740 --> 26:58.250
He's the former chief architect
of Xunchi Travel.

26:58.250 --> 27:00.310
With him leading our tech iteration,

27:00.330 --> 27:01.900
our system will be saved.

27:01.980 --> 27:02.810
By then, the user experience

27:02.810 --> 27:04.410
will reach a whole new level.

27:04.770 --> 27:05.700
Duan.

27:05.940 --> 27:08.070
800,000. An annual salary of 800,000.

27:08.200 --> 27:10.380
Have you checked how much money is left
in our account?

27:10.380 --> 27:12.250
We can barely pay our employees
next month.

27:12.250 --> 27:13.330
Let alone 800,000.

27:13.330 --> 27:15.390
I'd have to think twice about 80,000.

27:15.850 --> 27:18.140
This is what we call an investment.

27:18.500 --> 27:19.330
Right?

27:19.940 --> 27:22.460
If we don't lay a solid foundation
from the start,

27:22.460 --> 27:24.500
with constant bugs
and a terrible user experience,

27:24.500 --> 27:26.850
and users can't even unlock a bike
after trying twice in a single ride,

27:26.850 --> 27:28.380
who would use our bikes?

27:28.420 --> 27:31.050
No matter how much money we burn
on promotion,

27:31.050 --> 27:32.570
it'll all be in vain.

27:32.570 --> 27:34.010
What is the most important thing?

27:34.010 --> 27:34.850
The most important thing is

27:34.850 --> 27:37.420
that we need to focus
on the product itself.

27:39.420 --> 27:41.950
Users don't have such high demands
right now.

27:42.140 --> 27:43.380
As long as it unlocks
and they can ride it,

27:43.380 --> 27:45.090
and it's cheap, that's enough.

27:45.090 --> 27:46.850
We are marking our territory now.

27:46.850 --> 27:48.380
It's a period of expansion.

27:49.010 --> 27:50.180
Fine.

27:50.660 --> 27:52.590
Don't hire him if you don't want to.

27:52.940 --> 27:53.940
We're not on the same page.

27:53.940 --> 27:54.870
I'm going to eat.

27:55.890 --> 27:57.010
You...

28:01.360 --> 28:04.110
[Xian's Restaurant]

28:12.220 --> 28:13.010
Welcome.

28:32.090 --> 28:33.330
Do you know
how many new bikes our competitors

28:33.330 --> 28:35.220
put into the city this month?

28:35.770 --> 28:37.770
We need to spend our money wisely.

28:38.180 --> 28:40.510
We have to flood the market
with our bikes,

28:40.700 --> 28:42.420
gain a foothold, and survive.

28:42.660 --> 28:44.140
Then we'll talk about the rest.

28:44.140 --> 28:44.980
Survive?

28:45.940 --> 28:48.500
How can you do that
with a bunch of junk?

28:48.610 --> 28:50.530
Hou Wei, you're drinking poison
to quench your thirst.

28:50.530 --> 28:52.090
We still need to quench it first.

28:52.090 --> 28:53.750
If we die, we'll have nothing!

28:55.980 --> 28:56.570
Duan.

28:57.180 --> 28:59.290
Can you be a bit more realistic?

29:03.180 --> 29:03.980
Wait a moment.

29:14.220 --> 29:16.150
Hello, what would you like to have?

29:22.810 --> 29:24.330
Just a bowl of tonkotsu ramen.

29:24.330 --> 29:25.010
Thank you.

29:29.460 --> 29:30.980
The entire model is divided into

29:30.980 --> 29:33.050
4 sections: A, B, C, and D.

29:33.530 --> 29:34.980
Everyone has their own strengths.

29:34.980 --> 29:35.770
So,

29:35.620 --> 29:37.650
[Project Division]

29:35.900 --> 29:37.850
our coordination is crucial.

29:38.050 --> 29:39.450
Please look at this part.

29:40.290 --> 29:43.050
The convergence verification
of this module is very important.

29:40.410 --> 29:49.140
[Project Division]

29:43.380 --> 29:45.640
It is the foundation of our entire model.

29:46.220 --> 29:47.980
Shuwen, you have a solid math foundation.

29:47.980 --> 29:48.980
You'll handle this part.

29:48.980 --> 29:50.460
I'm not confident about that.

29:50.460 --> 29:51.660
If I want to graduate this year,

29:51.660 --> 29:53.460
I still have to polish my thesis.

29:53.530 --> 29:54.380
What if...

29:54.610 --> 29:56.570
What if I don't allocate my energy well

29:56.570 --> 29:58.050
and mess it up?

29:59.180 --> 30:00.940
Okay, I'll handle this part.

30:01.700 --> 30:03.180
You'll just work with Luo Ying

30:03.180 --> 30:05.090
to handle the data preprocessing.

30:05.090 --> 30:07.950
Make sure there are no issues
with the entire input.

30:08.530 --> 30:10.570
Shasha,
continue with the literature review.

30:10.570 --> 30:13.180
Focus on the Monte Carlo method

30:13.180 --> 30:15.090
and its latest application
to this problem.

30:15.090 --> 30:16.420
Compile a review for me.

30:17.220 --> 30:19.740
Lu Ping, for the code optimization
you're handling,

30:19.740 --> 30:21.500
give me a preliminary version
by tomorrow at the latest.

30:21.500 --> 30:22.230
Is that okay?

30:22.500 --> 30:23.290
Okay.

30:25.090 --> 30:26.620
Alright, let's get to work.

30:31.500 --> 30:32.140
Zhixia.

30:38.330 --> 30:39.260
This won't work.

30:39.940 --> 30:41.250
If you take all the core tasks
on yourself,

30:41.250 --> 30:42.450
you'll be exhausted.

30:45.420 --> 30:48.020
Yang Shuwen is obviously
just drifting along.

30:52.940 --> 30:53.810
I know that.

30:54.530 --> 30:56.130
But there's nothing I can do.

30:56.290 --> 30:58.620
I have to make sure the project continues.

30:58.700 --> 31:00.900
At least we are moving forward now,

31:00.900 --> 31:01.610
aren't we?

31:05.220 --> 31:05.850
Let's go.

31:19.070 --> 31:19.590
[Jiang Yubai]

31:19.610 --> 31:23.570
[What a nice day. What are you doing?]

31:34.990 --> 31:41.520
[Lin Zhixia]

31:36.940 --> 31:38.420
What a nice day.

31:39.180 --> 31:40.290
What are you doing?

31:53.750 --> 31:58.670
[Repayment Plan for the Next 3 Months]

32:08.610 --> 32:09.610
How does it taste?

32:09.660 --> 32:10.790
Is it to your liking?

32:12.290 --> 32:14.010
To be honest,

32:14.740 --> 32:17.700
it's delicious. The broth is so authentic.

32:18.700 --> 32:21.140
Thank you. I'm glad you like it.

32:21.860 --> 32:23.460
Are you usually around here?

32:24.410 --> 32:26.470
Yes, our company is not far from here.

32:27.050 --> 32:28.850
But how come I didn't know

32:28.850 --> 32:31.710
there was such a delicious noodle shop
around here?

32:33.740 --> 32:35.140
This is our ordering card.

32:35.140 --> 32:36.940
It has our phone number and menu.

32:37.090 --> 32:39.150
Contact us anytime you want to order.

32:40.090 --> 32:40.850
Okay.

32:41.220 --> 32:42.220
I will come often.

32:44.380 --> 32:45.180
Engineer Xie.

32:45.330 --> 32:46.330
This is our research group's

32:46.330 --> 32:48.640
computing power requirement form
for next quarter.

32:48.640 --> 32:49.840
Sorry to trouble you.

32:50.160 --> 32:51.690
Please arrange it this way.

32:52.920 --> 32:53.740
Dr. Tan.

32:54.610 --> 32:55.500
You have...

32:55.770 --> 32:58.570
taken up almost all

32:58.570 --> 33:00.110
the golden computing hours.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.250
Other projects,

33:01.570 --> 33:03.530
especially those requiring

33:03.610 --> 33:05.270
long continuous simulation,

33:05.700 --> 33:08.660
have been pushed
to early morning and weekends.

33:09.570 --> 33:11.610
And the duration
has been greatly compressed.

33:11.610 --> 33:13.010
This might not be enough.

33:14.510 --> 33:16.370
And Dr. Lin Zhixia

33:16.830 --> 33:19.360
also submitted
a detailed application to me.

33:19.810 --> 33:22.870
Her project has quite high
computational complexity.

33:23.000 --> 33:24.730
If we follow your arrangement,

33:25.000 --> 33:27.530
the resources left for her
will not be enough.

33:27.750 --> 33:28.810
I understand

33:29.110 --> 33:29.910
what you mean.

33:30.940 --> 33:32.540
But my project is different.

33:32.810 --> 33:34.440
It is a key project supported
by the department this year,

33:34.440 --> 33:35.420
with a clear requirement to produce

33:35.420 --> 33:36.660
landmark results.

33:36.980 --> 33:37.790
So all resources should naturally

33:37.790 --> 33:39.350
be directed toward the area
that best demonstrates

33:39.350 --> 33:41.660
our department's research capabilities.

33:41.660 --> 33:42.570
Am I right?

33:43.940 --> 33:45.090
That may be true,

33:45.720 --> 33:46.770
but what about Dr. Lin?

33:46.770 --> 33:47.570
Engineer Xie,

33:49.200 --> 33:51.610
let's be honest here.

33:52.540 --> 33:54.800
Who are the people with Dr. Lin right now?

33:55.790 --> 33:57.960
Yang Shuwen, whose graduation
was delayed for 2 years,

33:57.960 --> 33:59.810
Deng Shasha, and Lu Ping,

33:59.810 --> 34:01.640
who were just let go from my team.

34:03.930 --> 34:05.590
Actually, for some projects,

34:05.640 --> 34:07.110
their meaning of existence

34:07.110 --> 34:09.710
is not about
how many results they can produce,

34:09.739 --> 34:12.469
but rather to provide a place
for certain people.

34:13.250 --> 34:14.780
You know what I mean, right?

34:18.960 --> 34:19.820
Fine.

34:20.389 --> 34:21.210
I got it.

34:21.940 --> 34:23.070
We'll do it your way.

34:24.090 --> 34:24.690
Thank you.

35:35.400 --> 35:36.880
Master Jiang, it's me,

35:36.970 --> 35:37.630
Cheng.

35:40.050 --> 35:40.600
Coming.

35:47.200 --> 35:48.030
Master Jiang,

35:48.190 --> 35:49.170
great news.

35:49.420 --> 35:50.600
I got you a big order.

35:50.690 --> 35:52.420
Enough to feed you for 3 months.

35:52.530 --> 35:55.530
It will definitely update
your long vacation plan again.

35:55.530 --> 35:56.170
Tell me.

35:57.260 --> 35:58.660
It's a customized order.

35:59.130 --> 36:00.930
The requirements are very high.

36:01.630 --> 36:02.460
But

36:02.900 --> 36:04.630
the pay is definitely worth it.

36:06.190 --> 36:08.440
It's just that
they have a special request.

36:08.440 --> 36:10.670
The finished product
cannot have any of your marks,

36:10.670 --> 36:12.420
logos, signatures, or anything—

36:12.420 --> 36:13.210
none of them.

36:16.460 --> 36:17.780
Cannot have my mark?

36:18.500 --> 36:19.630
What does that mean?

36:20.570 --> 36:21.840
Take my stuff

36:22.010 --> 36:23.410
and put their brand on it?

36:23.950 --> 36:25.160
You think too much.

36:25.330 --> 36:27.880
They are not doing business
or making knock-offs.

36:27.880 --> 36:29.670
Just a bunch of rich kids
playing with cars.

36:29.670 --> 36:31.210
They want a batch of unique car stereos

36:31.210 --> 36:33.480
that can't be bought on the market.

36:33.690 --> 36:35.690
Just to show off, pure private toys.

36:39.300 --> 36:41.730
I guarantee it
with your next month's rent.

36:49.130 --> 36:49.940
Cheng,

36:51.110 --> 36:53.380
there are only 2 ways out for my stuff.

36:54.230 --> 36:56.730
Either bear my mark proudly,

36:57.300 --> 36:58.690
or rot in the warehouse.

37:00.730 --> 37:03.130
Want me to be a ghost technician
for others?

37:03.690 --> 37:04.420
No way.

37:05.380 --> 37:06.570
Bro, Brother Jiang.

37:06.590 --> 37:08.190
It's really not rebranding.

37:08.300 --> 37:10.280
It will never flow into the market.

37:11.460 --> 37:13.960
It's just a bunch of
vain young masters and misses.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.500
They want something unique

37:15.500 --> 37:17.620
and mysterious
that they can't tell the origin of.

37:17.620 --> 37:20.150
I guarantee
it won't damage your reputation.

37:20.730 --> 37:21.650
Besides,

37:21.940 --> 37:23.670
this order is very profitable,

37:24.690 --> 37:26.620
and it can solve your urgent needs.

37:30.150 --> 37:34.590
[Repayment Plan for the Next 3 Months]

38:11.210 --> 38:13.180
[Mom]

38:12.570 --> 38:15.170
Jin Baihui, what is wrong with you?

38:15.350 --> 38:16.880
Li Zhe is such a great catch.

38:17.190 --> 38:18.630
Why aren't you interested in him?

38:18.630 --> 38:20.160
I came with you to Huacheng.

38:20.690 --> 38:22.400
Your dad worked hard for so many years

38:22.400 --> 38:23.500
and didn't even take
the division director position.

38:23.500 --> 38:25.420
He took a half-rank demotion to come here,

38:25.420 --> 38:26.680
all for you.

38:27.340 --> 38:28.610
What are we doing this for?

38:28.610 --> 38:30.200
Tell me, what are we doing this for?

38:30.200 --> 38:32.250
Don't we just want you
to have a good life?

38:32.250 --> 38:33.780
Marrying well at your age

38:33.780 --> 38:35.730
is 100 times better
than working hard in the future.

38:35.730 --> 38:36.340
Why...

38:35.950 --> 38:36.640
[Mom]

38:36.630 --> 38:38.260
Why can't you just understand?

38:36.670 --> 38:40.970
[Back then, didn't I...]

39:20.130 --> 39:20.940
Dr. Lin.

39:22.800 --> 39:24.010
Engineer Jin?

39:24.450 --> 39:25.650
What brings you here?

39:26.320 --> 39:27.690
I knew you have been working hard
and forgot to eat,

39:27.690 --> 39:29.190
so I brought you some snacks.

39:29.190 --> 39:30.170
Great.

39:30.460 --> 39:31.590
Let me see what it is.

39:33.530 --> 39:34.690
Smells so good.

39:39.000 --> 39:41.010
I came out to get some fresh air too.

39:42.380 --> 39:44.040
What did your mom do this time?

39:45.840 --> 39:46.570
The usual.

39:48.670 --> 39:51.200
It seems all mothers in the world
are the same.

39:51.960 --> 39:53.940
If I had a mom like yours,

39:54.460 --> 39:56.460
I'd wake up laughing from my dreams.

39:57.670 --> 40:00.730
My mom has been complaining
in the group chat every day.

40:00.730 --> 40:02.460
What is she complaining about?

40:03.090 --> 40:03.900
My brother.

40:05.670 --> 40:06.470
Your brother?

40:07.030 --> 40:08.290
What's wrong with him?

40:09.090 --> 40:10.890
She keeps pushing him
to get a girlfriend every day.

40:10.890 --> 40:13.130
She sends him WeChat messages
every now and then

40:13.130 --> 40:14.460
with a bunch of

40:14.460 --> 40:16.650
matchmaking accounts.

40:16.670 --> 40:18.680
He is so annoyed.

40:19.690 --> 40:21.690
Elders are all pretty much the same.

40:24.070 --> 40:27.070
Doesn't your brother have any thoughts
on it himself?

40:27.190 --> 40:28.260
What thoughts could he have?

40:28.260 --> 40:29.660
He's like a block of wood.

40:29.690 --> 40:32.030
His girlfriend is code and game consoles.

40:33.380 --> 40:35.980
But my brother is actually quite obedient.

40:36.590 --> 40:38.390
He should be compromising soon.

40:43.590 --> 40:44.260
Oh, right.

40:47.670 --> 40:48.460
Take this.

40:49.300 --> 40:50.170
So much?

40:50.190 --> 40:51.380
I can't finish it all.

40:51.380 --> 40:52.380
It's from our department.

40:52.380 --> 40:53.570
I still have some in my dorm.

40:53.570 --> 40:55.500
Just think of it as helping me out.

40:57.080 --> 40:58.940
Thank you. I'll gladly accept it.

41:00.230 --> 41:01.650
This is delicious.

41:01.710 --> 41:02.840
Where did you buy it?

41:03.170 --> 41:04.050
It's very popular recently.

41:04.050 --> 41:05.380
I saw it on the internet.

41:06.090 --> 41:07.750
There's also sausage flavor?

41:09.920 --> 41:10.860
So many nuts.

41:11.900 --> 41:13.100
Let me taste this one.

41:21.110 --> 41:27.000
[Star Shine Media]

41:27.570 --> 41:29.760
Su Mo's performance has been good lately.

41:29.760 --> 41:31.170
He's got great momentum.

41:32.510 --> 41:34.510
You deserve a lot of credit for this.

41:34.820 --> 41:37.010
Although you haven't
been in the industry long,

41:37.010 --> 41:39.340
you're really good at guiding newcomers.

41:39.510 --> 41:41.570
It's impressive you've done so well.

41:42.030 --> 41:43.030
Thank you, Mr. Li.

41:44.010 --> 41:45.570
I came here today to see

41:45.570 --> 41:47.340
if the company could give Su Mo

41:47.340 --> 41:48.460
more resources.

41:49.260 --> 41:52.060
I think he will definitely
seize the opportunity.

41:56.960 --> 41:59.500
I've been thinking lately about

41:59.920 --> 42:01.090
how I can help you.

42:02.070 --> 42:03.170
With your abilities,

42:03.170 --> 42:05.530
you can definitely join a better team.

42:06.000 --> 42:09.000
You can only show your strengths
with more resources.

42:09.320 --> 42:09.960
Right?

42:11.530 --> 42:14.460
Bingbing has been
working on a lot of scripts lately.

42:15.210 --> 42:16.900
Her team is a bit overwhelmed.

42:17.610 --> 42:20.210
Have you thought about
going over to help them?

42:20.210 --> 42:22.420
You mean helping to read scripts?

42:24.670 --> 42:27.870
I want you to go over and be Bingbing's
executive manager.

42:29.260 --> 42:30.460
I've talked to her about it,

42:30.460 --> 42:31.320
and she agreed.

42:31.710 --> 42:33.310
This is a great opportunity.

42:33.820 --> 42:35.280
Do you want to give it a try?

42:37.380 --> 42:38.860
If I go over,

42:39.090 --> 42:40.500
can I still manage Su Mo?

42:42.070 --> 42:43.010
Bingbing

42:43.170 --> 42:44.940
definitely wants her team

42:44.940 --> 42:46.420
to focus on her work.

42:47.460 --> 42:49.400
And you know Bingbing's personality.

42:49.400 --> 42:50.860
As long as you do a good job,

42:50.900 --> 42:52.430
she won't treat you poorly.

42:57.030 --> 42:58.960
Mr. Li, I understand what you mean.

42:59.210 --> 43:00.980
Can you give me some time

43:00.980 --> 43:01.980
to think about it?

43:03.210 --> 43:03.900
Sure.

43:04.570 --> 43:06.300
Anyway, that's the situation.

43:06.670 --> 43:09.200
Let me know
whenever you've made up your mind.

43:09.690 --> 43:11.690
Okay, thank you. I'll head out now.

43:11.690 --> 43:12.380
Okay.

43:22.520 --> 43:27.140
[Server Room]

43:28.510 --> 43:31.040
Just leave the takeout at the door.
Thank you.

43:31.510 --> 43:32.420
It's me.

43:34.580 --> 43:35.340
Hi.

43:36.630 --> 43:37.820
What brings you here?

43:37.820 --> 43:39.860
Lin Zhixia asked me
to bring you something.

43:39.860 --> 43:41.090
She said you've been staying up late,

43:41.090 --> 43:42.900
so she wanted you to get some nutrition.

43:42.900 --> 43:44.730
She could've just sent
a WeChat message and I'd pick it up.

43:44.730 --> 43:45.570
Sorry to make you come all the way here.

43:45.570 --> 43:47.700
I was just on my way. Our department...

43:48.230 --> 43:48.960
is on the way.

43:50.210 --> 43:51.090
Then, please have a seat.

43:51.090 --> 43:52.050
I'll go get you a glass of water.

43:52.050 --> 43:52.690
Okay.

43:57.570 --> 43:58.900
Aren't you busy lately?

43:59.010 --> 44:01.740
Not too bad.
Just processing some data and stuff.

44:05.090 --> 44:06.410
Have some water first.

44:07.960 --> 44:09.560
I just noticed on my way up

44:09.710 --> 44:11.820
that your company really is all guys.

44:12.510 --> 44:13.210
Yeah.

44:13.920 --> 44:15.260
This industry, you know...

44:15.260 --> 44:17.690
Very few girls can handle it.

44:17.690 --> 44:19.690
You need to stay up late all the time.

44:20.300 --> 44:21.340
Wait a moment.

44:23.680 --> 44:26.380
Son, what do you think of this girl?

44:27.230 --> 44:29.690
Mom, can't you give me a break?

44:33.690 --> 44:35.730
How are your parents doing lately?

44:37.740 --> 44:39.420
They're doing well,

44:40.000 --> 44:41.210
but a bit annoying recently.

44:41.210 --> 44:42.540
They keep messaging me.

44:42.570 --> 44:44.100
Rushing you to get married?

44:50.880 --> 44:52.180
Lin Zhixia...

44:53.610 --> 44:55.050
If you tell her anything,

44:55.050 --> 44:56.510
the whole world will know.

44:58.390 --> 45:00.960
Yeah, I've been pressured a lot lately.

45:01.920 --> 45:03.900
But our job is just like this.

45:03.900 --> 45:05.010
From day to night,

45:05.010 --> 45:06.210
and from night to day.

45:06.300 --> 45:08.120
Can't help it.
It's the nature of the work.

45:08.120 --> 45:09.050
My mom told me

45:09.050 --> 45:10.780
to marry my job in the next life.

45:12.110 --> 45:13.770
Elders are all the same.

45:14.060 --> 45:16.170
Your mom is probably
just worried about you.

45:16.170 --> 45:17.300
My mom is the same.

45:18.110 --> 45:19.690
She's urging me to find a boyfriend.

45:19.690 --> 45:21.230
Parents are all the same.

45:22.390 --> 45:24.100
But I really have no choice.

45:24.130 --> 45:25.060
What should I do?

45:25.130 --> 45:26.970
Recently,
I've been asking my colleagues...

45:26.970 --> 45:28.860
to cover for me a bit.

45:30.280 --> 45:31.800
You can't just find someone randomly...

45:31.800 --> 45:32.960
can you?

45:33.260 --> 45:33.780
I have no choice.

45:33.780 --> 45:35.390
We barely have any girls here.

45:35.390 --> 45:37.260
So I can only ask my colleagues
to play along.

45:37.260 --> 45:39.390
How about you introduce me to someone?

45:40.040 --> 45:40.750
Me?

45:44.730 --> 45:45.380
Sure.

45:45.760 --> 45:46.890
What's your type?

45:47.070 --> 45:48.460
I like...

45:48.840 --> 45:50.310
I like...

45:50.510 --> 45:51.570
I like...

45:53.110 --> 45:54.630
Will someone like me do?

45:59.340 --> 46:00.730
Someone like you is great.

46:00.730 --> 46:02.130
I think it's pretty good.

46:08.510 --> 46:09.130
Then...

46:10.210 --> 46:13.260
I can pretend to be your girlfriend
for now.

46:15.880 --> 46:17.130
Pretend... for now?

46:17.230 --> 46:18.490
Like...

46:18.860 --> 46:20.500
when they want to video call you,

46:20.500 --> 46:22.380
or when they visit you,

46:22.380 --> 46:23.680
I can play along.

46:24.190 --> 46:27.450
This way, you can focus on your work
and finish the project.

46:30.510 --> 46:31.170
Right.

46:33.310 --> 46:36.970
I think I have some experience...

46:37.730 --> 46:39.090
in dealing with elders.

46:39.960 --> 46:40.750
Well...

46:40.880 --> 46:42.460
Of course, I don't know if your parents

46:42.460 --> 46:44.590
would be satisfied with a girl like me.

46:45.440 --> 46:47.030
My parents will definitely be satisfied.

46:47.030 --> 46:48.460
They will absolutely love you.

46:48.460 --> 46:49.210
Because I...

46:55.670 --> 46:56.940
Well...

46:57.380 --> 46:58.780
Is it convenient for you?

46:58.780 --> 46:59.460
I'm fine.

47:07.690 --> 47:08.500
That's great.

47:08.940 --> 47:10.090
Then it's settled.

47:10.800 --> 47:11.940
When I get paid this month,

47:11.940 --> 47:13.470
I'll treat you to a big meal.

47:13.800 --> 47:14.420
Okay.

47:16.530 --> 47:17.510
Looking forward to working with you.

47:17.510 --> 47:19.570
Looking forward to working with you.

48:11.740 --> 48:15.680
[Lin Zhixia]

48:13.730 --> 48:15.460
It's been 2 weeks, Jiang Yubai.

48:15.860 --> 48:17.190
Have you figured it out?

48:28.860 --> 48:33.100
[Repayment Plan for the Next 3 Months]

48:31.530 --> 48:33.460
The blueprints and requirements—

48:33.570 --> 48:34.430
let me see them.

48:34.920 --> 48:36.380
Here. Everything is here.

48:36.840 --> 48:38.440
They provide the materials.

48:38.530 --> 48:39.860
They have to be the best.

48:40.190 --> 48:40.940
I told them

48:40.980 --> 48:42.460
that only Master Jiang's craftsmanship

48:42.460 --> 48:43.610
can make it.

48:44.710 --> 48:45.480
Put it here.

48:59.230 --> 49:02.760
[Yubai]

49:10.410 --> 49:11.060
[Yubai]

49:29.530 --> 49:30.340
You know what?

49:30.840 --> 49:31.610
Actually,

49:31.940 --> 49:34.140
Sirius is 8.6 light-years away from us.

49:36.210 --> 49:38.570
Its brightness
is 25 times that of the sun.

49:38.960 --> 49:40.610
That's why we can see it

49:40.610 --> 49:41.540
from so far away.

49:44.030 --> 49:45.630
This beam of light took 8.6 years

49:45.630 --> 49:46.860
to reach Earth.

49:47.710 --> 49:49.420
That means before we even met,

49:49.730 --> 49:50.670
it had already embarked

49:50.670 --> 49:52.090
on the journey to meet us.

50:05.900 --> 50:09.060
[Promise]

50:12.760 --> 50:14.060
[I, Jiang Yubai,
promise that whenever and wherever,]

50:14.080 --> 50:15.590
[I will share my world with Lin Zhixia.]

50:15.610 --> 50:17.280
[We will explore and observe together.]

50:17.310 --> 50:19.120
[Promisor: Jiang Yubai]

50:53.650 --> 50:54.530
Jiang Yubai!

51:07.090 --> 51:08.020
Why are you here?

51:08.980 --> 51:10.510
I said you couldn't escape.

51:11.230 --> 51:12.490
No matter where you go,

51:12.650 --> 51:13.730
I will find you.

51:18.750 --> 51:20.030
[Human Observation Diary]

51:19.300 --> 51:19.920
Look.

51:29.980 --> 51:30.800
Promise.

51:35.130 --> 51:36.670
I, Jiang Yubai, promise

51:37.320 --> 51:38.360
that whenever

51:38.510 --> 51:39.400
and wherever,

51:39.670 --> 51:42.210
I will share my world with Lin Zhixia.

51:43.280 --> 51:44.280
We will explore

51:44.400 --> 51:45.660
and observe together.

51:46.030 --> 51:46.880
Promisor:

51:48.820 --> 51:49.610
Jiang Yubai.

51:57.260 --> 51:59.520
You said this yourself and wrote it down.

51:59.650 --> 52:01.050
You can't deny it, right?

52:01.840 --> 52:03.460
[Promise]

52:07.510 --> 52:09.110
It was just a childhood joke.

52:10.630 --> 52:12.290
How can you take it seriously?

52:12.320 --> 52:17.690
[Promise]

52:14.440 --> 52:15.770
It's in black and white.

52:15.940 --> 52:17.600
You can't go back on your word.

52:19.970 --> 52:22.920
[Promise]

52:26.490 --> 52:29.440
[Promise]

52:30.920 --> 52:31.630
Lin Zhixia.

52:32.710 --> 52:33.950
[Promise]

52:34.670 --> 52:35.820
Before, I said

52:37.440 --> 52:38.900
I needed to think about it.

52:40.360 --> 52:42.620
I really thought about it for a long time.

52:45.150 --> 52:47.010
We are not on the same track now.

52:48.500 --> 52:50.500
Even our directions are different.

52:51.920 --> 52:53.780
This is an unchangeable reality.

52:59.440 --> 53:00.480
Are you saying

53:02.980 --> 53:03.630
we...

53:05.780 --> 53:07.240
can't be friends anymore?

53:10.590 --> 53:11.530
Some things,

53:13.530 --> 53:15.260
once they happen, they happen.

53:17.610 --> 53:18.540
We can't go back.

53:22.170 --> 53:23.630
Let's not force it.

53:26.150 --> 53:28.280
Let's just let nature take its course.

53:30.840 --> 53:31.700
Don't force it.

53:57.740 --> 53:58.930
Let's make a bet.

54:00.730 --> 54:01.800
If I lose,

54:03.590 --> 54:05.320
I will never look for you again.

54:06.530 --> 54:07.720
Do you remember

54:08.420 --> 54:10.220
when we were under a tree before,

54:10.980 --> 54:13.070
and a leaf fell on your head?

54:15.530 --> 54:17.510
Why is there a leaf on my head?

54:18.530 --> 54:20.160
How did it fall on my head?

54:22.730 --> 54:23.610
There's a formula relating wind speed V,

54:23.610 --> 54:25.320
the falling leaf's initial height H,

54:25.320 --> 54:27.440
and wind direction θ.

54:30.900 --> 54:31.760
Jiang Yubai.

54:32.710 --> 54:34.170
If reality can't solve it,

54:35.550 --> 54:37.280
let's leave it to the universe.

54:45.880 --> 54:47.680
When the next gust of wind blows,

54:48.390 --> 54:50.200
if a leaf falls into your hand,

54:53.780 --> 54:55.150
you come back to me.

55:05.070 --> 55:05.480
Okay.

55:07.590 --> 55:08.590
I'll bet with you.

55:33.260 --> 55:34.060
Five minutes.

55:53.730 --> 55:57.780
♪ With every breath, the shadows creep ♪

56:00.780 --> 56:04.040
♪ A demon in disguise ♪

56:05.360 --> 56:08.260
♪ Talking the sweetest lies ♪

56:12.330 --> 56:15.870
♪ It tries to drown me in my sleep ♪

56:18.540 --> 56:21.990
♪ Pain comes like a tide ♪

56:23.220 --> 56:27.820
♪ It hurts,
but I'm way too tired to hide ♪

56:28.470 --> 56:33.440
♪ Will you please hold me, help me
walk out of this endless night ♪

56:33.740 --> 56:35.200
♪ I've lost my light and power ♪

56:35.350 --> 56:37.880
♪ Lost my will to fight ♪

56:38.280 --> 56:41.360
♪ Will you stand by my side ♪

56:42.680 --> 56:45.620
♪ Be my light tonight ♪

56:46.880 --> 56:55.980
♪ Let's run away ♪

56:56.730 --> 56:59.280
♪ Embrace the light ♪

57:00.410 --> 57:04.280
♪ With you, I'll win this fight ♪

57:05.030 --> 57:14.470
♪ Let's run away ♪

57:15.060 --> 57:17.630
♪ No time to cry ♪

57:18.550 --> 57:22.390
♪ Your love will guide us
through the night ♪

57:19.070 --> 57:19.780
I won.

57:24.320 --> 57:27.450
♪ You and I ♪

57:28.680 --> 57:32.120
♪ Endless night ♪

57:33.400 --> 57:36.630
♪ You and I ♪

57:37.190 --> 57:40.400
♪ I feel alive ♪

57:41.720 --> 57:46.440
[Jiang Yubai will always be
my best friend.]

57:52.190 --> 57:55.070
[Conclusion: Levels of Processing Theory]
[Working Memory Model]

57:58.100 --> 57:59.420
[Promise]

58:03.020 --> 58:08.540
[Promise]

59:27.260 --> 59:29.090
L-L-L-L-Lin Zhixia.

59:51.540 --> 59:59.200
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

01:00:00.320 --> 01:00:04.640
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

01:00:04.360 --> 01:00:05.420
You got a haircut?

01:00:05.170 --> 01:00:08.530
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

01:00:10.740 --> 01:00:18.480
♪ How to describe
my whimsical wandering dream? ♪

01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:14.660
It looks good.

01:00:19.400 --> 01:00:20.210
Yesterday,

01:00:19.730 --> 01:00:23.950
♪ You softly answer my quirky side ♪

01:00:21.480 --> 01:00:22.650
didn't we agree

01:00:23.800 --> 01:00:25.050
that I would teach you how to skateboard?

01:00:24.340 --> 01:00:27.680
♪ Such bliss to finally be understood ♪

01:00:27.440 --> 01:00:28.170
Yesterday?

01:00:29.150 --> 01:00:32.390
♪ The moon drifts past the window ♪

01:00:33.910 --> 01:00:37.490
♪ How am I to understand? ♪

01:00:35.480 --> 01:00:37.170
Don't you want to learn skateboarding?

01:00:37.170 --> 01:00:38.500
I'll take you tomorrow.

01:00:38.910 --> 01:00:39.950
♪ About you ♪

01:00:38.940 --> 01:00:39.570
Okay.

01:00:41.420 --> 01:00:45.760
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

01:00:43.190 --> 01:00:44.340
You're late.

01:00:46.430 --> 01:00:50.800
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

01:00:47.440 --> 01:00:48.170
Sorry.

01:00:51.320 --> 01:00:54.300
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

01:00:53.090 --> 01:00:54.350
It won't happen again.

01:00:54.870 --> 01:01:00.270
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

01:00:55.960 --> 01:00:56.610
Follow me.

01:01:00.440 --> 01:01:04.980
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

01:01:02.980 --> 01:01:05.070
Everyone is a jungle.

01:01:05.320 --> 01:01:09.850
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

01:01:05.860 --> 01:01:08.440
Every leaf is a world.

01:01:09.650 --> 01:01:11.000
Maybe they will never intersect

01:01:10.280 --> 01:01:13.350
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

01:01:11.320 --> 01:01:13.120
and will gradually drift apart.

01:01:13.550 --> 01:01:14.710
But as long as two worlds

01:01:14.000 --> 01:01:20.690
♪ Perhaps fate favors me now ♪

01:01:14.710 --> 01:01:16.940
desire to get close
to each other enough,

01:01:16.940 --> 01:01:19.800
the quantum entanglement
will become deep enough.

01:01:20.710 --> 01:01:23.980
One day, because of
this immense gravitational pull,

01:01:24.650 --> 01:01:25.920
they will converge

01:01:26.800 --> 01:01:27.960
and become one world.
